==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Dark]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s (100%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] (100%) spawns.

==Strategy==
As this stage consists of only [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, bring [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] units such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] / [[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]] if you have it. Don't forget meatshields either, as 4 Shadow Boxer Ks can easily push through your defences.

